# One of the four roles from SP-A02-1. Which one a node takes is the boot value `role`, read from
# a credential by workpod-role-generator; the image is the same artifact either way (AB-A02-1).
#
# `all` is a single node carrying every slice at once — the shape a small installation runs in, and
# the one A-06 exercises with `role=all`: an envelope arriving at intake and leaving as a patch, on
# one machine.
#
# Nothing is wanted below this target yet. The image carries no platform binary — that is AP-1.1's
# boundary — so what a role activates today is the target and nothing under it. AP-3.1 hangs the
# first services here.

[Unit]
Description=Workpod node role: all
Documentation=https://github.com/Cheety/warft/blob/main/01-specification.md
